k"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"THE真剣な感じね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全く入らないかと思ったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナインゲームでは最後もばっちり決めて勝ったよヽ(^ω^)ﾉわーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビリヤードアイドルとして\nあみと活動しようかと\n真剣に考えたのよ(´･-･`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩みの種"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆーことでね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっんとに充実した２日間を過ごしてきたよ＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は牧場とか、旭山動物園とか行ってみたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のメンバー紹介は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりこの人でしょ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ。(๑•ૅω•´๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみとは最近仲良くて結構一緒にいる時間多いかもなーヽ(^0^)ﾉ\n最近メンバーの中であみに似てると\n噂されるようになってきたのも\n最近になってからで笑\n影響されてるみたいよ(´Д` )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってこんなに面白くて場を明るく笑いに包ませる人なんて\nあみが初めてだとおもう！\n無意識に、人を笑顔にさせるあみに憧れたのかもしれない(^^)/\nあみ、最初はすごい人見知りで話しかけづらい感じで喋れなかったの。\n意外でしょ？笑\nだけど今はこんなだし人ってわかんないねー(´Д` )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段はこんなんでもあみダンスとかすごい上手だしかっこいいよ！\n人知れず隠れて努力してるんだなーって思った(*´ω`*)\nくぅぅぅぅかっこいいぜ\nあみみたいになりたいかも！笑\n大好きやー(๑•ૅω•´๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わりっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこ収録ねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったよ楽しかった(  ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木メンほんとすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またねん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´>∀<｀)ゝ"}],"source":"archive"}